  "content": "<!--\nrdf:RDF xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"\n         xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n         xmlns:trackback=\"http://madskills.com/public/xml/rss/module/trackback/\">\n    <rdf:Description\n        rdf:about=\"/abs/2607.27197\"\n        dc:identifier=\"/abs/2607.27197\"\n        dc:title=\"The Maxwell Conjecture is False\"\n        trackback:ping=\"/trackback/2607.27197\" />\n    </rdf:RDF>\n-->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div id=\"abs-outer\">\n   <div class=\"leftcolumn\">\n    <div class=\"subheader\">\n     <h1>Physics &gt; Classical Physics</h1>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-breadcrumbs-mobile\">\n     <strong>arXiv:2607.27197</strong> (physics)\n    </div>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/static/base/1.0.1/css/abs.css\">\n    <div id=\"content-inner\">\n     <div id=\"abs\">\n      <div class=\"dateline\">[Submitted on 29 Jul 2026]</div>\n      <div class=\"authors\">\n       <span class=\"descriptor\">Authors:</span><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/physics?searchtype=author&amp;query=Arathoon,+P\" rel=\"nofollow\">Philip Arathoon</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/physics?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ball,+G\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gavin Ball</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/physics?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kvalheim,+M+D\" rel=\"nofollow\">Matthew D. Kvalheim</a>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"mobile-submission-download\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.27197\">View PDF</a> <a class=\"mobile-submission-download\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2607.27197v1\">HTML (experimental)</a>\n      <blockquote class=\"abstract mathjax\">\n       <span class=\"descriptor\">Abstract:</span>We exhibit a configuration of five point charges in Euclidean space whose electrostatic potential admits at least 24 critical points all of which are non-degenerate. Maxwell's conjecture that the field of \\(n\\) point charges has at most \\((n-1)^2\\) critical points which are all non-degenerate is therefore false.\n      </blockquote>\n      <!--CONTEXT-->\n      <div class=\"metatable\">\n       <table summary=\"Additional metadata\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">Subjects:</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell subjects\"><span class=\"primary-subject\">Classical Physics (physics.class-ph)</span>; Mathematical Physics (math-ph)</td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">Cite as:</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxivid\"><span class=\"arxivid\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197\">arXiv:2607.27197</a> [physics.class-ph]</span></td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">&nbsp;</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxividv\">(or <span class=\"arxivid\"> <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197v1\">arXiv:2607.27197v1</a> [physics.class-ph]</span> for this version)</td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">&nbsp;</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxivdoi\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2607.27197\" id=\"arxiv-doi-link\">https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2607.27197</a>\n           <div class=\"button-and-tooltip\">\n            <button class=\"more-info\" aria-describedby=\"more-info-desc-1\">\n             <svg height=\"15\" role=\"presentation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\">\n              <path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M256 8C119.043 8 8 119.083 8 256c0 136.997 111.043 248 248 248s248-111.003 248-248C504 119.083 392.957 8 256 8zm0 110c23.196 0 42 18.804 42 42s-18.804 42-42 42-42-18.804-42-42 18.804-42 42-42zm56 254c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12h-88c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h12v-64h-12c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h64c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12v100h12c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12v24z\" />\n             </svg>\n             <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Focus to learn more</span>\n            </button>\n            <!-- tooltip description -->\n            <div role=\"tooltip\" id=\"more-info-desc-1\">\n             <span class=\"left-corner\"></span> arXiv-issued DOI via DataCite (pending registration)\n            </div>\n           </div></td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"submission-history\">\n     <h2>Submission history</h2>\n     From: Philip Arathoon [<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/show-email/c8c20320/2607.27197\" rel=\"nofollow\">view email</a>]\n     <br>\n     <strong>[v1]</strong> Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:58:42 UTC (341 KB)\n     <br>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--end leftcolumn-->\n   <div class=\"extra-services\">\n    <div class=\"full-text\">\n     <a name=\"other\"></a> <span class=\"descriptor\">Full-text links:</span>\n     <h2>Access Paper:</h2>\n     <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.27197\" aria-describedby=\"download-button-info\" accesskey=\"f\" class=\"abs-button download-pdf\">View PDF</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2607.27197v1\" class=\"abs-button\" id=\"latexml-download-link\">HTML (experimental)</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/src/2607.27197\" class=\"abs-button download-eprint\">TeX Source </a></li>\n     </ul>\n     <div class=\"abs-license\">\n      <a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" title=\"Rights to this article\" class=\"has_license\"> <img alt=\"license icon\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://arxiv.org/icons/licenses/by-4.0.png\"> <span>view license</span> </a>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <!--end full-text-->\n    <div class=\"browse\">\n     <h3 class=\"browse-context-heading\">Current browse context:</h3>\n     <div class=\"current\">physics.class-ph</div>\n     <div class=\"prevnext\">\n      <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button prev-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2607.27197&amp;function=prev&amp;context=physics.class-ph\" accesskey=\"p\" title=\"previous in physics.class-ph (accesskey p)\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;&nbsp;prev</a> </span> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">&nbsp; | &nbsp;</span> <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button next-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2607.27197&amp;function=next&amp;context=physics.class-ph\" accesskey=\"n\" title=\"next in physics.class-ph (accesskey n)\" rel=\"nofollow\">next&nbsp;&gt;</a> </span>\n      <br>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"list\">\n      <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-new\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/physics.class-ph/new\" rel=\"nofollow\">new</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-recent\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/physics.class-ph/recent\" rel=\"nofollow\">recent</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-id\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/physics.class-ph/2026-07\" rel=\"nofollow\">2026-07</a>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"abs-switch-cat\">\n      Change to browse by:\n      <div class=\"switch context-change\">\n       <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197?context=math\" rel=\"nofollow\">math</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n       <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197?context=math-ph\" rel=\"nofollow\">math-ph</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n       <a class=\"subclass\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197?context=math.MP\" rel=\"nofollow\">math.MP</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n       <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197?context=physics\" rel=\"nofollow\">physics</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <h3>References &amp; Citations</h3>\n     <ul>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-ads\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/arXiv:2607.27197\">NASA ADS</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-google-scholar\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?arxiv_id=2607.27197\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Scholar</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-semantic-scholar\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/arXiv:2607.27197\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Semantic Scholar</a></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <button type=\"button\" id=\"bib-cite-trigger\" class=\"bib-cite-button abs-button\">export BibTeX citation</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bookmarks\">\n     <div>\n      <h3>Bookmark</h3>\n     </div>\n     <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"http://www.bibsonomy.org/BibtexHandler?requTask=upload&amp;url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197&amp;description=The Maxwell Conjecture is False\" title=\"Bookmark on BibSonomy\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/bibsonomy.png\" alt=\"BibSonomy\"> </a> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"https://reddit.com/submit?url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197&amp;title=The Maxwell Conjecture is False\" title=\"Bookmark on Reddit\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/reddit.png\" alt=\"Reddit\"> </a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--end extra-services-->\n   <!-- LABS AREA -->\n   <div id=\"labstabs\"></div>\n   <!-- END LABS AREA -->\n   <div class=\"endorsers\">\n    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/auth/show-endorsers/2607.27197\" class=\"endorser-who\" rel=\"nofollow\">Which authors of this paper are endorsers?</a> | Disable MathJax (<a href=\"https://info.arxiv.org/help/mathjax.html\">What is MathJax?</a>) <span class=\"help\" style=\"font-style: normal; float: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 1em;\"></span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文提出了一组五个点电荷的构型，其静电势具有至少 24 个非退化临界点，从而否定了麦克斯韦猜想，即 n 个点电荷的临界点数最多为 (n‑1)²。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文提出了一组五个点电荷的构型，其静电势具有至少 24 个非退化临界点，从而否定了麦克斯韦猜想，即 n 个点电荷的临界点数最多为 (n‑1)²。",
  "summary": "作者在欧几里得空间中构造了五个点电荷的显式排列，并分析了由此产生的静电势的临界点。他们表明该构型至少产生 24 个非退化临界点，超过了麦克斯韦猜想预测的上界 (5‑1)² = 16。本文包含详细的几何构造、非退化性的证明，以及对该猜想在经典和数学物理中的影响的讨论。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "特定的五电荷构型产生至少 24 个非退化临界点。",
      "explanation": "作者通过将电荷放置在双锥的精心挑选的顶点并求解梯度方程，表明该势具有 24 个不同的非退化驻点，超过了预测的最大值 16。"
    },
    {
      "point": "该构造对于 n = 5 的情况推翻了麦克斯韦猜想。",
      "explanation": "麦克斯韦猜想认为，n 个点电荷的静电势的非退化临界点数受 (n‑1)² 的限制。所展示的反例违反了这一界限，从而证明猜想错误。"
    },
    {
      "point": "该结果对静电平衡配置的研究具有启示。",
      "explanation": "由于该猜想曾引导人们对电荷平衡复杂性的预期，其被证伪为研究多电荷系统的平衡点和稳定性开辟了新方向。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "我们展示了一个在欧几里得空间中的五个点电荷构型，其静电势至少具有 24 个临界点，且所有这些点都是非退化的。",
    "麦克斯韦猜想认为 n 个点电荷的场最多具有 (n‑1)² 个临界点且全部为非退化的，因此该猜想是错误的。"
  ],
